<title>JAPAN: Diamond City -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Diamond City -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.58		vs	    4.65</p>
<p> Operating	  850    million    vs	  713    million</p>
<p> Current	    749    million    vs	  513    million</p>
<p> Net		  367    million    vs	  670    million</p>
<p> EPS		   17.58 yen	  vs	   32.07 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     21 million	  vs	  21 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Diamond City Co Ltd is an operator of shopping centres.</p>
